  "port": 4321,
  "projectDescription": "I need to build The Puzzle School website as a static website that can be hosted on GitHub pages. I have designs for the first two pages. I'd like to use codeyam-cms to make it easy to change content and add pages without touching the code. Can we explore how best to do this? We control codeyam-cms as well so we can make improvements to it as needed.",
